# HOSTKEY invapi.hostkey.ru API token (hostkey.ru account, not .com -
# they're separate endpoints), used by acme/dns_hostkey.sh (a custom
# acme.sh dnsapi hook - HOSTKEY has no official plugin) for the Let's
# Encrypt DNS-01 challenge. Required for wildcard certs: HTTP-01 can't
# issue them. Get a token from the HOSTKEY control panel's API keys
# section (see https://hostkey.ru/documentation/apidocs/api/).
HOSTKEY_TOKEN=

# Only needed if the zone ever isn't fqrmix.ru - dns_hostkey.sh hardcodes
# that default.
# HOSTKEY_ZONE=fqrmix.ru
